 "remarks": "**PLEASE SUBMIT ALL OFFERS BY 5:00 PM ON MONDAY, MAY 11. SELLER WILL REVIEW AND MAKE A DECISION BY TUESDAY MORNING.** Welcome home to this beautifully maintained 3 bedroom, 2.5 bath townhome, ideally situated in the heart of downtown Stamford. Enjoy effortless access to everything the city offers while living in a space that feels both comfortable and refined. The main level features a welcoming living room with a cozy fireplace, a dedicated dining area, a well appointed kitchen, and a convenient half bath - an ideal layout for everyday living, easy entertaining, and holiday gatherings. Upstairs, the primary bedroom offers a peaceful retreat with its own private bath, skylight, and private deck. Two additional bedrooms and a shared hall bath complete the sleeping levels, providing plenty of space and flexibility. This townhome truly checks all the boxes: two reserved underground parking spaces, a low monthly HOA fee, and no pet restrictions. Step outside and embrace a truly walkable lifestyle - award winning dining, the farmers market, street fairs, theaters, and parks are all just moments away. Metro North is only a mile from your door, making your commute to NYC a breeze in under 50 minutes. An added bonus for investment minded buyers: no rental restrictions, making this an exceptional opportunity in one of Downtown Stamford's most desirable locations. Schedule your showing today and experience all this home has to offer.",
